{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a baseline multimodal setup combining RNA data encoded with PCA and image data encoded with ResNet50 via simple concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest the multimodal approach achieves moderate performance, but no direct comparison to unimodal baselines is available. The role of encoder complexity and fusion strategy remains uncertain without additional experimental benchmarks."
}

